# Editor and IDE state. Deliberately not committed: several agents work
# in different tools, and a shared .idea/ or .vscode/ means every session
# produces a diff that has nothing to do with the code.
.idea/
.vscode/
*.swp
.DS_Store
*.log
npm-debug.log*
pnpm-debug.log*

playwright-report/
test-results/
.vite/

# UI reference material, kept locally and out of history on purpose.
#
# These are the screenshots and the screen recording the UI is designed against.
# `JIRA 5.mp4` alone is 11 MB, and git stores every version of a binary forever —
# one re-record and the clone is 22 MB heavier permanently, for a file nothing
# builds from. They are read by whoever is designing a surface, which is a local
# activity.
#
# If a reference ever needs to be shared, the right move is a compressed still
# committed next to the spec that cites it, not the source recording.
UI Images/
